    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f90587e396b8d5be488bfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何，请多关照！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f84ed8938b63bb013aa922878760951598356041ee20ff6d56d0527d2c5cc262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979e15b5c72f277af5e2ab4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——第二天。\n我一边阅读都留岐涼花发来的邮件，\n一边思考接下来该怎么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b7fa11d03102fe5908ffc2bb12d05b9ea3dd78593788131b6dd46fd7d5d70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83c5fc53ec572e9296f93b89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——接受各种各样的竞技训练，\n与各异的马娘运动员在大会中竞争。\n这是求之不得的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f85ed077afffb39e1bf63aaee0e66a39b5bfc8a899c028c5f3ddac5c172586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b35820207dfb7811fc580ad5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果顺利的话，\n这可能会成为<chrname>在未来的比赛中\n可以活用的一部分……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f4d1e75706be8e49bfb5e4fe3a97bbafbfb6b6174ac8e151fef234e4ad2c900",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf8583e19fd17f7cb7c0b44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……之后，在与<chrname>的商谈中，\n表明了自己的想法——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f487af7cdb283735c7a4bcd3d6e1a978b122a30fb893cd7c311dafb81ab587f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1401665efa5dcf208ab62eb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在得到<chrname>的同意之后，\n我决定参加『U.A.F.』的说明会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5160311a5e52f6bda15abbfedf021def6b0697685bc9a8558beba00018a2a4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66252f106b8e4634864e4db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af0bf33e3a2fb714962c1d721e5cf6f39c5c91272e02ad7a37b5c46c12033ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fefcdf8e2f8a051dbec1556f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了说明会的会场，我环顾四周。\n……除了自己和几个人外，\n似乎没有其他特雷森学园的训练员参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c1b06d7ef05264206e5a96ccbd4aa4fac0b5c121da9bf0cd1a03709ec14f2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b50b887e15c3dd1b692bec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（但是，这正是一个机会）",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a7f064493597048b460cbb2d27f853382b90d7cf928a1f4767cee9158f86b17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e26b5490e58bc600e81b2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为想让所负责的马娘专注于赛跑\n而选择不参加。\n同为训练员，我可以理解这样的想法——",
      "source_fingerprint": "58048e445de78a0f1fa263f58c4b8f501176b1c2aeed92d962ad4c1d4cb8a1bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc5b2dcaa037b326070eb63f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果参加了这个『U.A.F.』，\n能够得到什么的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "25eb0c7661f73bc3dab108087147ce3202f03fda1312770ffaeb7cda10f7471c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb44acf9a2edf5378a6ce26f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "索侬艾尔菲",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9b12fdd304a650e8ee9687fb50026b44caddb262a88aace81294f220f407d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
