    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b213ed758cb1ae4f0abe450d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……认真听讲的时间里，说明会转眼间就结束了。\n总结一下今天的讲话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a3392d9e56c73e958cdd82c5312a90be7ea029517bb8ed3fbf0ad1c7ea7749d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a479b5463427349fb6f82c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——『U.A.F.』\n历时两年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7acc9c5979841a14297861230a19076d218b5a9ee1f5b3b47a6c4c47af8c17fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c8e7a1126fa8064c07fbb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这两年将主要由预选赛和决赛构成——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4213c37666a1fca4d61938e9624cb7125c801f3832a9021483754ede22daed34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c00ae4272cd2595bd0fc4cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "预选赛每半年在全国各地举行一次。\n共计举行3次，这3次的总成绩\n排名前列者将进入决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e47ee89b55cfb5cebdc235c2d4929cf74eb23bf8877458e90cdcee356fa61b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b0621739aa449f37233d05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，决赛将会在两年结束时，\n在比预赛更大的会场举行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213e9b5fbc4935b612973837572c1652a787172828f54a0642318788853e4b08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d99dd120af44cdfa76dd812",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这里获胜的人将得到\nNo.1马娘运动员的荣耀——",
      "source_fingerprint": "35cf4ec2df0c2bfb5760ddd440db77f5b4030c3b7c53eacc2a41544caa1b8a54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac4e11cee57d0f3a278f181",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但是，今年不会直接举办『U.A.F.』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "092b3da566e1a71fd589b0959dd0e8e5b3be3c1a4bc0415018ba00ebd97191c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9bdc47fec3fd2a0c39a4645",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尔菲的粉丝C",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cab6b911feb425a8ba4fbb3a30d1fb706061b9074156bf6986c347eaabd9888",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
