      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b835b3f37dfa02e10f88930",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——啊，喂，太疯狂了吧！\n这，得有几层啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d493965e0b9d33b4793f7da7f8ca6107e1c6dd6d17f3573892a7227cb1f809d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b518f6ea665b5849aac459d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据都留岐涼花说，今年12月将举行\n类似正式比赛的测试大会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5a6af7c37f87e550a46831a43070756da40c2116ef0ba093c1547efe84a0f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5bfbb73aaa5f65bd4c37d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这次测试大会上将确认今后的运营方法，\n并进行大会的宣传活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d088a25f5b7b911db8ed34994ffffd0c0368c7b1cfd8a2a4d539b41c8db04a77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d5f8e4d8775ade8ffd2c9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，希望参加大会的人\n也被要求参加这次测试。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2b414e425c02537d0aae65931dfac4f64aee781288ba588266e5b145f9fb53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc3dd35c73a1696c0f1345d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……如果想要认真地参加『U.A.F.』，\n并取得成功的话，\n那么参加这次测试大会的意义就很大了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "165c690aabb796bd96cc20cb97b097252558980104fddcc277960a868b74026c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0007/storytimeline_400007000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        83,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/83/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac97fd86459aa7e1e02fa846",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<chrname>有机会通过『U.A.F.』\n成长为一名运动员吗？\n这应该是用作判断的关键……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11c4962393d1b6958e502f94df86fb2054d586e60e16fd3d5970264c2fdaba87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
