      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么样，今天的讲话让您\n对『U.A.F.』产生兴趣了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1f5ddf86dcfac491a174af26ef4dfbf1ad60bc54d929f55efe37937993b292",
