      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "非常感谢。\n作为特雷森训练员的您能这么说，\n我感到很荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1c96998aaff549f7af9692b651670978376eed11d8bf7f7bc345c01309d4047",
